+//===== rAthena Script =======================================
+//= Gold PC Bonus NPC
+//===== Description: =========================================
+//= NPC that can be spawned via the Gold PC Timer Button.
+//===== Changelog: ===========================================
+//= 1.0 Initial release [Lemongrass]
+//= 1.1 Replay version [eppc0330]
+//= 1.2 Translation of the replay version [Lemongrass]
+//= 1.3 Cleanup of NPC logic [Lemongrass]
